  "expirationDate": "2016-06-07",
  "historyNote": "#8683, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-17-06, EXPIRED: 1-13-07 New. #8799, eff 1-19-07; ss by #9173, eff 6-7-08 (from He-P 308.04), EXPIRED: 6-7-16",
